# ExecDaat — Cloudflare Pages SPA Redirects
# Routes all direct-URL navigations to the SPA (index / Worker)
# The JS router then reads location.hash and activates the right tab.
# These must come AFTER /api/* and /static/* (Cloudflare evaluates top-to-bottom,
# but _worker.js takes priority for /api/*, so this only matters for HTML routes).

/dashboard    /    200
/payments     /    200
/contracts    /    200
/autonoma     /    200
/settings     /    200
/otc          /    200
/swap         /    200
/multisend    /    200
/history      /    200
